  "module_docs": [
    "Port of",
    "`net.minestom.server.network.packet.server.play.ChunkDataPacket`.",
    "",
    "`ChunkData` and `LightData` live in Java's `...server.play.data` package,",
    "which another partition owns; this packet references them through",
    "`crate::network::packet::server::play::data`.",
    "",
    "Note on equality: Java's `LightData` is a record over `List<byte[]>`, and a",
    "record's generated `equals` compares the list elements by identity, so a",
    "decoded light payload never compares equal to the one that was written. That",
    "is Java's behaviour and the probe records it; the port does not \"fix\" it."
  ],
